---
import MathLayout from '../../../layouts/MathLayout.astro';
import { getPath } from '../../../utils/path';

const lang = 'zh';
const currentPath = '/zh/university/category-theory';
const title = '范畴论';
---

<MathLayout {title} {lang} {currentPath}>
	<article>
		<h1>{title}</h1>
		<p class="intro">范畴论是数学的"元语言"，研究对象之间的态射关系，为不同数学领域提供统一的抽象框架。</p>

		<h2>为什么学习范畴论？</h2>
		<blockquote>
			<p>"范畴论是数学家们发明来谈论数学的数学。"</p>
		</blockquote>

		<h2>核心概念</h2>
		<div class="concepts-grid">
			<div class="concept-card card">
				<h3>对象 (Objects)</h3>
				<p>范畴中的基本元素，可以是集合、群、拓扑空间等任何数学对象。</p>
			</div>
			<div class="concept-card card">
				<h3>态射 (Morphisms)</h3>
				<p>对象之间的箭头，表示结构保持的映射关系。</p>
			</div>
			<div class="concept-card card">
				<h3>合成 (Composition)</h3>
				<p>态射的合成，$g \circ f$ 表示先应用 $f$ 再应用 $g$。</p>
			</div>
			<div class="concept-card card">
				<h3>恒等态射 (Identity)</h3>
				<p>每个对象的恒等箭头，不改变对象。</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>重要定理</h2>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>Yoneda Lemma (米田引理)</h3>
			<p>范畴论中最基本的结果之一，表明对象可以由它到其他对象的态射完全决定。</p>
			<div class="formula">
				<code>Nat(Hom(A,-), F) ≅ F(A)</code>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>学习路径</h2>
		<div class="learning-path">
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">1</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>范畴基础</h3>
					<p>对象、态射、合成、恒等态射、交换图</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">2</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>函子与自然变换</h3>
					<p>函子（范畴之间的映射）、自然变换（函子之间的映射）</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">3</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>极限与余极限</h3>
					<p>积、余积、终对象、初对象、纤维积</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">4</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>米田引理</h3>
					<p>表示定理、预层、层、伴随函子</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">5</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>单子与代数</h3>
					<p>单子（Endofunctor）、代数、自由结构</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>与其他学科的连接</h2>
		<div class="connections">
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">←</span>
				<span>集合论 - 集合范畴 Set，函数作为态射</span>
			</div>
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">←</span>
				<span>群论 - 群范畴 Grp，同态作为态射</span>
			</div>
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">←</span>
				<span>拓扑学 - 拓扑空间范畴，连续映射作为态射</span>
			</div>
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">←</span>
				<span>代数几何 - 概形范畴，态射是重要的研究对象</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>推荐教材</h2>
		<ul class="book-list">
			<li><strong>Category Theory for the Working Mathematician</strong> - Saunders Mac Lane，范畴论之父的经典著作</li>
			<li><strong>Categories for the Working Philosopher</strong> - 偏哲学视角</li>
			<li><strong>The Starred Sequence</strong> - 深入浅出的在线教程</li>
		</ul>

		<div class="nav-footer">
			<a href={getPath('/zh/university')} class="back-link">← 返回大学数学</a>
		</div>
	</article>
</MathLayout>

<style>
	.intro {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	blockquote {
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
	}

	.concepts-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #f1f5f9;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.concept-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.theorem-card {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
		border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
	}

	.theorem-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
		color: #f1f5f9;
	}

	.theorem-card p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
	}

	.formula {
		padding: 1rem;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
		border-radius: 8px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.formula code {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: #a5b4fc;
	}

	.learning-path {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.path-step {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.path-step:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.step-num {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 2rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eab308, #f97316);
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-weight: bold;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.step-content h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
		color: #f1f5f9;
	}

	.step-content p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.connections {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.connection-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.75rem;
		background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.05);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.conn-icon {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: #eab308;
	}

	.book-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.book-list li {
		padding: 0.75rem;
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
		background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 3px solid #eab308;
	}

	.nav-footer {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: #eab308;
	}
</style>
